Lemma "user/R2real (a2>0): the real vcd-equation is a genuine quadratic".
"  ==>  \forall wn (\forall Rg (\forall Cf (\forall Lg ((((wn) > ((0)))&(((Rg) > ((0)))&((Cf) > ((0)))))->((((((1))-((((wn)^((2)))*(Lg))*(Cf)))^((2)))+((((Rg)*(wn))*(Cf))^((2)))) > ((0)))))))
\qed::8b80d07fa06ac789b90646dca4481a31"
